<mxPoint x="1654" y="830"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="&lt;b&gt;Foreign keys to users that record who acted&lt;/b&gt; (assignments.created_by, extensions.student_id / authorised_by, class_extensions.authorised_by, submissions.student_id, marks.entered_by, feedback.author_id, moderation_decisions.hod_id, release_records.released_by, mark_audit.actor_id) are marked &lt;b&gt;FK … → users&lt;/b&gt; in the column lists instead of being drawn as lines. Partial unique indexes enforce one current version per submission and one current mark per submission." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#B8A100;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="700" width="600" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>